WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:13,100
Do you recommend clear, multi-bind for most people?

00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,100
Well, not everybody needs it.

00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,100
So, certainly in the summertime,

00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:22,100
if you're out sweating a lot or if you're doing sodas on a regular basis,

00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:25,100
taking a mineral supplement is good.

00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,100
If you're taking the greens, supplements,

00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,100
and you're eating real well and you're eating,

00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:32,100
where do you get your minerals from and your diet?

00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:36,100
You get your minerals from your vegetables.

00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:40,100
So, if you're for people who in general,

00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:44,100
for people who are like not big vegetable eaters,

00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,100
they don't eat a lot of salads,

00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,100
they don't like a lot of vegetables,

00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:51,100
or their idea of vegetables is corn.

00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:54,100
Corn is a grade not a vegetable.

00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:57,100
So, if that's their idea of vegetables,

00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,100
they're probably deficient to minerals,

00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:03,100
and yes, they should be taking a product like clear multi-bind.

00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:05,100
But even for our patients, you know,

00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:07,100
most of our patients are eating really well,

00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,100
eating better than they have in their life,

00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:12,100
some of them taking the green supplement,

00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:13,100
well, clear multi-bind,

00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:16,100
is it necessarily necessary for everybody?

00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:19,100
So, the reason why we use the clear multi-bind

00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:21,100
is it's iron-free,

00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,100
because why would you want to not be on iron?

00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:26,100
Well, iron is highly inflammatory.

00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:29,100
If you're deficient and you have anemia,

00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:32,100
then you may need to be on an iron.

00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:34,100
But if you're not,

00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:36,100
if you're not endemic,

00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:38,100
then you shouldn't be taking iron.

00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:42,100
And you shouldn't be taking iodine.

00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:46,100
If you have any hint of any possible

00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:49,100
Hashimoto's thyroid issues

00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:51,100
or other autoimmune issues,

00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:53,100
you want to limit your iodine levels.

00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:57,100
So, that's why we picked that product.

